# Paths excluded from the marketplace release package.
#
# Read by scripts/build-marketplace-release.sh. Every line is a path prefix or
# glob relative to the repository root. Comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# The package is built from `git archive`, so anything already untracked or
# gitignored (a real .env, node_modules, storage contents, the signing key)
# never enters the archive in the first place. THIS file is the second layer:
# it removes things that ARE committed but must not reach a customer.
#
# Three categories, and it is worth keeping them separate in your head:
#
#   1. LICENSOR CODE - the licence server. Shipping it would hand a customer
#      the machinery that mints licences. It is inert without the private key,
#      which never leaves our server, but there is no reason to ship it.
#
#   2. OUR INFRASTRUCTURE - deploy configs, runbooks and internal docs that
#      describe reelsoo.com's own servers. Not secret in themselves, but a
#      free map of our production estate.
#
#   3. NOISE - development-only files that make the package larger and
#      confusing without helping anyone.

