# The whole docs/ tree, not just docs/internal/.
#
# These are OUR runbooks - deployment-plan.md, scaling-plan.md,
# two-vps-setup-plan.md/html - and they describe the reelsoo.com production
# estate: host roles, the two-VPS split, tunnel layout, which services run
# where. That is a map of our infrastructure, and it is category 2 above.
#
# They also carry placeholder credential lines (DB_PASSWORD=STRONG_DB_PASSWORD,
# APP_KEY=base64:GENERATED_BY_KEY_GENERATE) which trip the release secret scan.
# The right fix is not to loosen the scanner - it is that these files have no
# business in a customer package.
#
# docs/LICENSING.md is licensor documentation too: it covers keygen, release
# publishing and the private signing key. Customers get INSTALL.md instead,
# which the build script generates into the package.
